|---:|---:|---:|
| 1 | 0.109698705 | 0.066644995 |
| 2 | 0.065107134 | 0.055756478 |
| 3 | 0.055117222 | 0.048601794 |

Selected epoch 3 after 96 Adam updates. Held-out MSE 0.050325811.
