> Fixed cases expose reconstruction and retrieval failures

The next two galleries choose the first held-out image of each true digit in source order,
with no output-quality selection. Rows run from digit 0 to 9. The reconstruction columns are
original, AE32, inverse-projected code PCA2 then decoded, raw pixel PCA32 and raw pixel PCA2.
Grayscale display clips to [0,1] while raw PCA arrays and raw MSE remain unchanged.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/visualization_reconstruction_gallery.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  std::map<std::string, n::Tensor> a;
  for (const auto& [key, value] : n::load_npz("build/visualization/analysis.npz"))
    a.emplace(key, value);
  const auto labels = a.at("test_labels").to_vector<int>(),
             ids    = a.at("test_source_ids").to_vector<int>();
  const std::vector<std::string> fields{
      "test_images",
      "test_ae_reconstruction",
      "ae_projected2_decoder_reconstruction",
      "pixel_pca_test_reconstruction",
      "pixel_pca2_test_reconstruction"};
  std::vector<n::Tensor> panels;
  std::print("| digit | fixed held-out source ID |\n|---:|---:|\n");
  for (int digit = 0; digit < 10; ++digit) {
    const auto row = std::find(labels.begin(), labels.end(), digit) - labels.begin();
    if (row == 200)
      return 1;
    std::print("| {} | {} |\n", digit, ids[row]);
    for (const auto& field : fields)
      panels.push_back(
          n::cast(n::take_rows(n::models::DoubleSampleRows(a.at(field)), {row}), n::DType::Float32)
              .reshape({1, 28, 28, 1}));
  }
  n::save_image_grid(
      n::concat(panels, 0),
      "build/visualization_reconstruction_gallery.png",
      5,
      0,
      1,
      4,
      220. / 255.,
      3);
}
```
